  "scope": "Proves repeatable actual finite-factor elimination and binds it to the original SU(2) Wilson law at arbitrary finite depth. Actions and normalized sources are computed recursively; lifted fixed-coordinate laws reproduce the true retained marginal on retained observables. Exact covariance telescoping and variance accounting use each genuine induced law. Generated factor supports and arbitrary nonlinear response supports are derived at every stage, with dyadic diameter/radius and incidence envelopes and no reintroduction of removed coordinates. Current-support independence gives a derived product conditional law and actual removed covariance cancellation. Actual Wilson plaquette coefficients satisfy |Cj|<=4 at every depth; sampled kernels vanish beyond (4*2^j+2)a under explicit periodic no-wrap geometry. Cumulative degree-four contact errors are bounded by C*p05(F)*a*R^4*sum(cj^9)+4*weightedMoment_m(F)*J/(a^8*R^m). On J=k,a=2^(-16k),R=2^k,n=16*2^(17k),m=144,cj=3*2^j, the actual accumulated remainder tends to zero on every Schwartz test. Exact cell pairing proves rescaled original covariance minus the sum of actual contacts equals rescaled kth retained covariance plus o(1) on every real Schwartz tensor. An explicit admissible schedule removes k distinct links; its first two share a plaquette and are not jointly initially independent. Generic maximal block packing also gives one-step density/progress bounds. This controls growing ultraviolet eliminations, not fixed-physical-scale blocking: the largest physical neighborhood is bounded by 12*2^(-15k). No uniform retained continuum bound, bracket sign, nonzero continuum theory or physical mass gap is proved.",
  "actual_repeated_construction": {
    "factors": "At every step, explicitly integrate independent current coordinates and generate the literal negative-log fiber potentials. The new finite factor inventory, supports, continuity and locality are constructed recursively.",
    "fixed_space_law": "The same configuration type is used by lifting each actual exterior marginal with independent reference Haar variables in removed positions. The proved boundary-integral dictionary ensures all retained observables use the true induced marginal.",
    "sources": "Arbitrary nonlinear sources depending on several selected coordinates are handled by exact cancellation of inactive conditional-product factors; the normalized actual response has the computed union-of-stars support.",
    "geometry": "Starting from actual Wilson plaquettes, stage factors have periodic diameter<=2^j and plaquette responses have center radius<=2^j. Current-support independence is checked anew, or derived from coordinate separation.",
    "accounting": "Cov_original=sum_{j<N}Gram_j+Cov_N under the actual successive laws; diagonal removed forms are nonnegative and their sum is at most the original variance.",
    "amplitude": "Every actual plaquette response remains in[0,4], so every stage coefficient satisfies |C_j(p,q)|<=4, independently of depth and coupling."
  },
  "growing_physical_repair": {
    "kernel": "K_{a,j}(x,y)=a^-8*C_j(sample x,sample y), using the actual jth action and normalized jth source responses.",
    "locality": "K_{a,j}=0 beyond (4*2^j+2)a in the pair ball when 2R+(2*2^j+1)a<n*a. This is derived from current product-law independence and actual response supports.",
    "contact": "At each stage subtract the integrated degree-four diagonal Taylor jet inside radius12*2^j*a. Every finite cumulative contact is a continuous complex-linear full-Schwartz functional supported on the diagonal.",
    "bound": "Error<=C*p05(F)*a*R^4*sum_{j<J}(c_j^9)+4*weightedMoment_m(F)*J/(a^8*R^m), including all periodic aliases and global tails.",
    "path": "J=k,a=2^(-16k),R=2^k,n=16*2^(17k),m=144,c_j=3*2^j. All j<k no-wrap conditions hold. Accumulated local and tail factors are bounded by3^9*2^(-3k) and2^(-15k).",
    "physical_identity": "a^-8 Cov_original-sum_{j<k}contact_j=a^-8 Cov_k+o(1) on every real Schwartz tensor, for any coupling sequence and any computed-support-admissible block sequence at each cutoff.",
    "separated": "Diagonal-disjoint tensors kill all contacts, giving full-minus-kth-retained covariance tending to zero. This preserves a possible signal but does not supply one.",
    "limit_of_scope": "The largest removed physical radius is bounded by 12*2^(-15k), which tends to zero. This is unbounded ultraviolet elimination, not a controlled passage to a fixed positive physical scale; the final retained covariance remains explicit and unestimated."
  },
  "block_construction": {
    "one_step_packing": "A maximal independent subset of the current active inventory is constructed solely from current supports. It is nonempty while coordinates remain, strictly reduces the inventory, and satisfies |active|<=(t*d+1)|block| when factor size<=d and incidence<=t.",
    "growth": "Current incidence doubles at most each step. Explicit factor-size bounds are proved; no uniform physical-scale density bound follows automatically.",
    "global_witness": "The constructed schedule uses transverse direction-one links at vertices whose coordinate zero is j modn, with singleton block j for j<n. On the path its first k blocks are nonempty, pairwise disjoint and remove exactly k coordinates.",
    "nontrivial_support": "The first two selected links belong to the same actual(0,1) plaquette, so their union is not initially factor-independent. Each singleton is nevertheless admissible for the actual evolved support family.",
    "scope": "This explicit global witness is sparse, not an extensive coarse-graining schedule. Shared interaction support is not a proof of nonzero covariance for arbitrary beta, including beta=0."
  },
  "remaining": [
    "Bound the actual final retained interacting covariance and prove a nonzero separated reflected signal, with the actual physical logarithmic bracket signs. Exact growing-depth subtraction preserves this unknown retained term rather than estimating it.",
    "Extend the proved growing ultraviolet elimination regime to a fixed positive physical scale with quantitative control of generated interaction strengths and retained source cumulants. The largest neighborhood in the new path is 12*2^(-15k), so it still shrinks to zero.",
    "Construct and control a complete coarse-graining schedule with appropriate physical-scale density and normalization. A maximal admissible block is proved available at each finite stage, while the explicit global schedule removes only k distinct one-link blocks from a much larger lattice.",
    "Prove cutoff-independent all-order interacting correlation bounds and compatible higher partial-diagonal counterterms, including mixed retained/noise cumulants. Uniform bounded plaquette coefficients and two-point contact estimates do not provide this hierarchy.",
    "Establish symmetry/positivity-compatible continuum field reconstruction, the physical coupling trajectory and nonzero normalization, relative physical transfer-energy control, all field/domain/cyclicity/spectrum properties, and every compact simple gauge group. All twelve full Clay requirements remain open."
